gVisor runtime-visibility PoC for Kubescape node-agent
======================================================

This project includes material derived from the gVisor project
(https://github.com/google/gvisor), licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

  - proto/common.proto, proto/container.proto, proto/sentry.proto,
    proto/syscall.proto
      Copied from pkg/sentry/seccheck/points/ with import paths flattened and a
      go_package option added. Used to generate internal/pb.
  - internal/wire/wire.go
      A faithful reimplementation of pkg/sentry/seccheck/sinks/remote/wire.

third_party/ contains pinned, unmodified clones of the protobuf Go runtime
(google.golang.org/protobuf), github.com/golang/protobuf, and
github.com/google/go-cmp, vendored so the PoC builds without a module proxy.
Each retains its own upstream LICENSE.
